## Original Content
Глава региона Владимир Сальдо отметил, что аграрии работают в тяжелой обстановке

## Summary
Attacks by the Armed Forces of Ukraine (VSU) in the Kherson region have destroyed 170 hectares of crops, according to regional head Vladimir Saldo, who noted that agricultural workers are operating under difficult conditions.

## Key Points
- 170 hectares of crops destroyed in Kherson region due to VSU attacks
- Agricultural operations in the region face challenging conditions
- Regional head Vladimir Saldo reported the damage


